  displayTitle: "Dispensary Log \u2014 Torn"
  bodyText: 'The cabinet code is the ward count, not a date. First wheel: how many
    beds Ward Two was licensed for. Second: how many were actually in use the night
    of the fire. Third: how many of those were ever signed out again.'
